# Loops (loops.so) API key for newsletter signup.
# Loops → Settings → API. The key is WORKSPACE-scoped: whichever workspace it
# belongs to is where these signups land. Unset = /api/subscribe returns a 500
# and logs the dropped address rather than failing silently.
LOOPS_API_KEY=

# Mailing list IDs live in src/pages/api/subscribe.ts. All Trades Show forms
# opt into new episode announcements, monthly updates, and seasonal stakeholder
# messages. They do not add the bi-weekly opportunity digest. LOOPS_API_KEY must
# belong to the existing The Corral workspace, where these lists are managed.
